2. rawtoaces-data (Academy Software Foundation)
-----------------------------------------------
The spectral prior is built from the 52 camera spectral sensitivity files, and
the fitting uses the 190-patch training reflectances, from
https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/rawtoaces-data, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
The Sony ILCE-7RM4 and ARRI D21 curves shown in the comparison chart are
unmodified from that repository.

3. colour-science
-----------------
Colorimetric functions (CMFs, illuminants, CAT02, CIEDE2000, test reflectance
sets) come from colour-science (https://www.colour-science.org), BSD-3-Clause.
The CIE 2017 colour evaluation samples are CIE data (CC BY-SA 4.0) and are used
only for testing; they are not redistributed here.
